  rdfs:label "Vocabulary | Domain | Marketing"@en ;
  skos:changeNote "1.1: 272 concepts added for ontology-domain-marketing 1.1 and taxonomy-domain-marketing 1.0, covering competitive intelligence, demand generation, channel and partner marketing, events, product marketing, marketing compliance and PEO offerings. Existing concepts and their broader links are unchanged. Unused caie: and sp: prefixes removed."@en, "This is the initial version of the vocabulary definitions to be refined over time with input from other stakeholders & resources." ;
  skos:editorialNote "Some concepts are realised by more than one ontology class (for example a process, its capability and its service). Those classes share this concept through dc11:subject."@en, "Verizon Knowledge Engineering acknowledges that some definitions contained within this vocabulary were generated with the assistance of VZGPT (vzgpt.verizon.com) or Google Gemini." ;
